  "rules": [
    "Compiler/test stages annotate parent execution; never add them again to execution sum.",
    "Human wait requires explicit human resolution provenance. Automatic/policy/unknown is distinct.",
    "Event interval crossing phase/goal is ambiguous, not prorated.",
    "Context sizes require dedicated fields; compaction request input is separate."
  ]
